ubuntuguard (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First stable release: 40-rule baseline audit, reversible hardening,
    detection, monitoring, backups, reports and systemd integration.
  * Verified on Ubuntu 22.04.5 and 24.04.4 with 163 automated tests.

